    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "关于论文《An Interactive Machine Translation Framework for Modernizing Historical Documents》，What kind of data is used to train the model?",
      "turn_id": "7b103ef441334b8bb45d5042bf1dd217"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": {
        "claims": [
          {
            "key": "corpora_used",
            "text": "实验使用三个语料库：荷兰圣经（Dutch Bible）、El Quijote 和 El Conde Lucanor。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "dutch_bible_versions",
            "text": "荷兰圣经语料包含1637、1657、1888和2010等不同版本；作者只使用1637版（作为原始文档）和1888版（将19世纪荷兰语视为现代荷兰语）。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_quijote_corpus",
            "text": "El Quijote 语料包含17世纪西班牙语原著及对应的21世纪版本。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "el_conde_lucanor_test_only",
            "text": "El Conde Lucanor 语料包含14世纪原著及对应的21世纪版本，但由于语料规模小，仅用作测试。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "conde_uses_quijote_systems",
            "text": "由于找不到合适的训练语料，作者使用为 El Quijote 构建的系统来现代化 El Conde Lucanor。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-2b39005de67979a14fc26cd7"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "nmt_parallel_corpora",
            "text": "在NMT中，模型参数是在大型平行语料库上使用随机梯度下降联合估计的。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-ab6e4f648559a50bb0a797c2"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "key": "small_training_corpora",
            "text": "训练语料规模小被认为是NMT的已知问题，可能解释SMT优于NMT的表现。",
            "citations": [
              {
                "paper_id": "1910.03355",
                "chunk_id": "c-98f92e50001a68c58a20c08e"
